{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "dc0d8ab0b9aed870e2cef9d814a895727367dd979e0b6603f3418d11655467e7", "ja": "お姫さまたちの宝物", "zh": "公主们的宝物", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "4403f81b72020ee8ed248275bca96eda06499f1b93c6d04dda4fd56e66509afb", "ja": "夕暮れの屋上で、大盛況だったPrincess\nの公演に思いを馳せる未来達。新たな夢の\n話。そして、打ち上げの話で盛り上がる彼女\n達は皆、これからもっと輝いていくだろうと\n予感させる笑顔を浮かべていた。", "zh": "未来等人在落日时分的屋顶上回想\n盛况空前的Princess公演，并诉说新的梦想。\n她们热烈地聊着庆功宴的话题，\n每个人的脸上都露出了让人预期\n今后会更加发光发热的灿烂笑容。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8deda4550a47047f520f3f0a40aa782269a068cb644e3f3bb1d77be3ac50d1d3", "ja": "（Princess公演は大歓声の中、その幕を閉じた）", "zh": "（Princess公演在热烈的欢呼声之中落幕了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_07_1001_p", "source_sha256": "34b0b1c3c1c4f29966dbf58b941ab0a1ba25b0995214a2c5825e1cc1f58f3272", "ja": "（そしてその翌日……）", "zh": "然后隔天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_07_1002_026yur", "source_sha256": "ac9ab85323674e582cccbbbf041c14dfa4255324f2cae7f7aa5abfe6fef9317e", "ja": "あの、{$P$}さん……？", "zh": "那个，{$P$}先生……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_07_1003_p", "source_sha256": "a067308a114ba704da94d67b69fe100f42cd54337f21494406fe9b2a895ce99b", "ja": "どうしたんだ？　百合子。", "zh": "怎么啦，百合子？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_07_1004_026yur", "source_sha256": "73040355e942c64256bffb6c0731da67cd9a9378ec87ee2c925d94f9f4e88284", "ja": "へ、変なことを聞いちゃうんですけど、私たち……。\n昨日ここで、ライブ……しましたよね？", "zh": "我、我想问你一个奇怪的问题，我们几个……\n昨天在这里，举办了……演唱会对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_07_1005_p", "source_sha256": "6a7b10498f8cac5cbb62654d689a3a4acbd9e98cb88468e2d5da937f815bc5f2", "ja": "ああ。大成功だったな。みんなのオープニングナンバー\nを皮切りに、一瞬も目が離せないステージだった。", "zh": "当然，表演非常成功喔。从你们开始唱开幕歌曲之后\n就毫无冷场，让人无法移开目光。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_07_1006_014mir", "source_sha256": "723c31f437608375230576e28475b6631bfbc5177876aa82b2a53560ce772c37", "ja": "ほらね！　やっぱり夢じゃなかったでしょ！", "zh": "看吧！我就说那个不是梦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_07_1007_026yur", "source_sha256": "24e4dc0f19259c033e5d692c718b84d8b483c47efeee9215dd252a1a4d938c80", "ja": "でもでも、あの大歓声とか高揚感というか……\nあの時と同じ場所に立ってるのが、信じられなくて。", "zh": "可是可是，那个如雷般的欢呼和亢奋感……\n我实在无法相信自己就站在跟那时一样的地方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_07_1008_032emi", "source_sha256": "38f967c016a10648586138ea9e6a341c754184d6908ef834c3a55c77c6d9a0ed", "ja": "百合子さんのその気持ち、わかります。\n昨日の公演が、本当に夢のようだったからこそ……。", "zh": "我能明白百合子的感受。\n因为昨天的公演，真的就像梦一场……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_07_1009_021mat", "source_sha256": "713465b717f122de09d1e025aa242ef8d770dadc6291fbb7a7f3fd76d438a631", "ja": "それだけ姫達のステージが、\nわんだほー！だったということなのです♪", "zh": "这代表公主我们的表演，\n就是这么美妙的喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_07_1010_021mat", "source_sha256": "2cc9644d6ddfa1690390150c66d5d53e29282f606d9d558e96b558f5afcb1288", "ja": "特に、可奈ちゃんのパフォーマンスは、\n忘れられない思い出になったのです。", "zh": "尤其是小可奈的演出，\n真的成了我们难以忘怀的回忆呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_07_1011_036kan", "source_sha256": "8310aeeed1aa5694540660a79d1788a4107862dbf9997c746977ab397967e2cf", "ja": "うう、ごめんなさ～い……。楽しすぎて、\n歌詞がすっぽーんて抜けちゃって～。", "zh": "呜呜，对不起～人家唱得太开心，\n歌词就突然飞出脑海了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_07_1012_014mir", "source_sha256": "9b00ab12f3c4021bf7682d0cf57a642b6f03c2a5573e21e98bbb082e69e56b4c", "ja": "でも、よかったね！\nお客さん達が代わりに歌ってくれて！", "zh": "不过，真的很棒呢！\n观众竟然帮忙接唱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_07_1013_032emi", "source_sha256": "29e906955621d270135974eb1a0aee93d211bca80137276d50a74eeb05a1eace", "ja": "あの光景には、とても感動しました……。\n舞台と客席がひとつになる、まさに和の心です！", "zh": "那副光景，真是太感人了……\n舞台和观众席合而为一，这正是大和之心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_07_1014_036kan", "source_sha256": "0f90dd0a27992f4003866b93455116d9faf3f6139876671a09a18979d642a1ff", "ja": "うん……結局みんなと一緒に歌えて、楽しかったんだ。\nでも今度は～忘れないぞ～♪　ごほうびはお菓子～♪", "zh": "嗯……最后能和观众一起唱歌，真的很开心。\n不过下次～我不会再忘词了～♪奖赏是点心～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_07_1015_026yur", "source_sha256": "613fcdc2441e972ee21e034c5ab8b02d7958ef1afd1df1c5207007e9f00b14bb", "ja": "ふふっ、なんだか、あの時の劇場も、\n合宿の続きみたいだったね！", "zh": "呵呵，感觉那个时候的剧场，\n也像是集训的延续呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_07_1016_p", "source_sha256": "c15ce7bb0d4fce478a5a830fd19f1e7c18e5253d9a28da5c446a573a9b9e1ef4", "ja": "そうか……。もしかしたら、みんなの雰囲気が、\nお客さんにも伝わったのかもしれないな。", "zh": "原来如此……说不定是你们的氛围，\n感染了在场的观众呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_07_1017_021mat", "source_sha256": "3eee06f88dfa92c1f7457c65d420e2629d255e3bc554ab7eaab49a7844ddb030", "ja": "そうなのです。合宿では、みんなのいろいろな\n新しいところを発見できたのです♪", "zh": "没错的喔。集训时，\n发现了大家各种新的一面呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_07_1018_014mir", "source_sha256": "eb91cc2ed47fe18508f52802ec7136a720be943e0814e027b82f77a52569ad9c", "ja": "あ、そういえば！\n私、合宿中にすっごいもの、見つけちゃったんです！", "zh": "啊，说到这个！\n我在集训时，发现了一个大惊喜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_07_1019_036kan", "source_sha256": "1b216bc058b4f1d1c309a310cbd6f30c3b818d4f01ee526acbaa00ff67770e91", "ja": "すっごいもの……？", "zh": "大惊喜……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_07_1020_014mir", "source_sha256": "c8b82e8943952b7dfd8090c9f57b315c886025cc3004a8b9534f010f5f848bb4", "ja": "ちょうどいい時間だから、今から一緒に見に行こうよ！\n{$P$}さんも！", "zh": "现在时间正好，我们一起去看吧！\n{$P$}先生也一起来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_07_1021_014mir", "source_sha256": "9333a4065e16052a27e4bcb4dd7d6c6bb1936964c61112cea2fb588ddd21eb20", "ja": "じゃっじゃ～ん！", "zh": "锵锵～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_07_1022_032emi", "source_sha256": "8d6fc8f5e8990f1fd29e4b068f25bb91e108788678ffc4d956a034a6a5b4e4b8", "ja": "わぁ……、綺麗な夕日です！", "zh": "哇……真是美丽的夕阳！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_07_1023_p", "source_sha256": "6371c880bf2be3bfa0ecc0d0977d61171dedfdd664552edcbac5a478b7a3a508", "ja": "これは……。", "zh": "这是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_07_1024_014mir", "source_sha256": "878d42c47525be84e5d9279aed50471600199eb7ef3b6205604018aba33cd4fc", "ja": "{$P$}さん、知ってました？\nこの劇場、屋上があったんですよっ！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，你知道吗？\n这座剧场是有屋顶的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_07_1025_p", "source_sha256": "cd641977dc448e7fa656fe55b20b10f220dc46fe905a3bc47e4bc13281e42d25", "ja": "いや、それは知ってたけどな？\n俺はこの劇場の立ち上げに関わってたから……。", "zh": "这我当然知道啊，\n我当初可是有参与剧场的建设……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_07_1026_014mir", "source_sha256": "0f8863a01f3b5ee5b115219444cd16dd4ebca1c06663ff705d27b99567e8146d", "ja": "えっ？　じゃあ、この屋上って、\n{$P$}さんが作ったんですか！？", "zh": "咦？那么，这个屋顶\n是{$P$}先生盖的吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_07_1027_021mat", "source_sha256": "d1e41576db01a48a9484dd6522bdc5f54c78c189f0d00c0ad7b51d2b6d42a57b", "ja": "わんだほー！なのです♪　姫もここからの\n景色は、とってもお気に入りだったのです。", "zh": "真是美妙的喔♪\n公主也一直非常中意这边看过去的景色呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_07_1028_014mir", "source_sha256": "f11320e30bd7ad29a0bc8b5e9dbb50867a6b9c0fe325024fb6ce69e2dcb701ba", "ja": "まつりちゃんも？\nじゃあ、ひょっとして、みんなも……？　なんだ～。", "zh": "连茉莉也知道？\n那该不会，大家其实都……？什么嘛～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_07_1029_p", "source_sha256": "7b144318a13c4f3d31c6d2c7eb087bc8b150e1ae7cf9093245df35b29b9f4e1f", "ja": "いや、でも俺は、ここから見る夕日が\nこんなにキレイだなんて、知らなかったよ。", "zh": "可是我，从来不晓得这里看过去的夕阳\n竟然那么美呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_07_1030_p", "source_sha256": "24b00264982bdf442a2b30a3b0c45d3b420ced6cb99cd99a750135cee5166aa8", "ja": "教えてくれてありがとう、未来。", "zh": "谢谢你告诉我，未来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_07_1031_014mir", "source_sha256": "fa4976c636b57b22e64af4a5a411c7736853d3c37cd2c8ae9265cfbf99fc3d53", "ja": "そうなんですねっ。\nじゃあ、やっぱりよかったです。でへへ♪", "zh": "是这样啊！\n那有带你来果然没错，嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_07_1032_036kan", "source_sha256": "84f1c1b6f0ada4d13c0eb1f83a7b4da080bf4167c09814eec40c97448d799b7b", "ja": "そうだ！　ここでなら、いつでも歌の練習できるかも！\n屋上～極上～♪　練習に最上～♪", "zh": "对了！在这里的话，搞不好随时都能练唱喔！\n屋顶～最棒～♪最适合练唱～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_07_1033_026yur", "source_sha256": "f0acfe16d1de83c9d3ee253ac72e08c914d135a36ea7e63cdd04f93363068841", "ja": "今回の公演では、私……たくさん思い出ができました。\n合宿のこと、夜のステージのこと、この景色……。", "zh": "这次的公演，我……留下了好多回忆。\n集训、夜晚的舞台，还有这副景色……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_07_1034_026yur", "source_sha256": "049d0097600126ae88146504ac8e26645dbe5566b9be6635c043b1dc8d7ac31f", "ja": "私の自叙伝に欠かせない名場面が、\nなんだか、盛りだくさんになりました！", "zh": "我的自传中不可或缺的名场景，\n感觉要多得数不清了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_07_1035_032emi", "source_sha256": "58f2b573606f5a55260de4657e5e9fff4e8b0dec930cd6eea90f6e77b4e8509f", "ja": "あの、仕掛け人さま？　また、あのような合宿を、\nしていただけませんか……？", "zh": "请问，策划执行人先生？可以麻烦您\n再举办像那样的集训吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_07_1036_p", "source_sha256": "cdec5c9dc8387cd3d2a74c261de937bbe73b96a531110c4f45e5cb8409a09e24", "ja": "そうだな。大変なこともあったけど……\nたまにはいいかもな！", "zh": "我想想，虽然也有累人的地方……\n但偶尔为之好像不错！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_07_1037_032emi", "source_sha256": "f61fffb3a320b6e5f37ba1690bde7dcd66a9ca9aa55b8c2d51cb1704765a7d6f", "ja": "Wow！　ぜひお願いします！\n私、また銭湯で、みなさんと洗いっこがしたいです！", "zh": "Wow！那就万事拜托了！\n我想再到澡堂和大家一起互相刷背呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_07_1038_032emi", "source_sha256": "db32dfb6dc69383f540ef2065fd75c3b1b25df9fef7858af249b2471c669b30c", "ja": "はっ！　私ったら、は……はしたない……。", "zh": "啊！我真是的，说出这么不……不得体的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_07_1039_021mat", "source_sha256": "98889301e67705e41a0b80dda8e452f3682c7b6b7c6ab442bb3055de5125ceb2", "ja": "{$P$}さんは、やっぱり姫たちの\n願いをかなえてくれる、立派なナイトさまなのです♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生果然是会实现\n公主们心愿的帅气骑士的啊♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_07_1040_021mat", "source_sha256": "b0d481a15fe8971104a2c801263e03742edec313930086723f7bc28adb48d56c", "ja": "これからも、姫たちの願いを、\nかなえてください、なのです。……ね？", "zh": "从今以后，你也要继续实现\n公主们的心愿的喔……呐？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_07_1041", "source_sha256": "ee2f25c4be0d3769e921b49126f8b952970b2ca1df781eee6de09fdb91ca0ac3", "ja": "力の限り！", "zh": "尽力而为！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_07_2000_p", "source_sha256": "25a2dcb62e63653a80e970b9d83fe3b81ee72eff99e7af9936e3b8e820398fc9", "ja": "もちろんだ！\nこれからも力の限り、みんなを支えていくよ。", "zh": "这是当然！\n从今以后我也会尽力支援大家的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_07_2001_p", "source_sha256": "cee53b6cd0ba4ffe8a6f200c5cd687fa346cb99cb8f2e2e3f9543bdcccd10b69", "ja": "で、とりあえずは、Princess公演の成功を祝って\n打ち上げをしようか。みんなはどうしたい？", "zh": "总之，我们先来举办庆祝Princess公演\n成功的庆功宴吧。大家想吃什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_07_2002_014mir", "source_sha256": "0b35b6c08e284b6cf94b86a26427d2255d7f149b4db90ecfb7feef10da565d5d", "ja": "やったー！　何がいいかな～。\nたとえば、ちょっといいファミレスとか！", "zh": "太好了──！要吃什么呢～\n比方说有点高级的家庭餐厅！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_07_2003_021mat", "source_sha256": "178aa64eb49fab2163a99f0318556e2a7ef842b9c8af2d83e3933a13471cead2", "ja": "せっかくですから、この屋上で、\n夜にバーベキューというのはどうです？", "zh": "都到这里来了，不如晚上\n就在屋顶上吃BBQ怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_07_2004_032emi", "source_sha256": "9794f9ae6bf0a6f27c333a461c041ae06c23eb7e54a70249162094290d946d7c", "ja": "Wow！　炭火焼肉料理、とても楽しそうです。\n私、ぜひみなさんと一緒にやってみたいです！", "zh": "Wow！炭火烤肉料理，感觉很有意思。\n我非常想和大家一起试试看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_07_2005_036kan", "source_sha256": "3ee6b9b9eabe491c3997ad5b76d7d12d7afd216ceeefaa896a7c8f17adaa5c0e", "ja": "わーい、バーベキュ～！　お肉も野菜もざっくざく～♪\nみんなの笑顔もざっくざく～♪", "zh": "耶～BBQ～！肉肉菜菜越切越多～♪\n大家的笑容也越积越多～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_07_2006_026yur", "source_sha256": "1232b3027b6fa47042b129cb5f35c0719defa0e41f1a374bfa8f3b2391743cde", "ja": "星空の下のバーベキュー……。すごくロマンチック\nですよね、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "在星空下吃BBQ……\n感觉非常浪漫呢，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_07_2007_p", "source_sha256": "66fc6473590c52682b76d28c2e30f9a4ab104c8f968fab326475e2d5ff222661", "ja": "そう……かもな！　よし、まずはみんなで、\n商店街のお肉屋さんと八百屋さんへ、買い出しだ！", "zh": "或许……是吧！那好，大家先一起去\n商店街的肉铺和蔬果店采买吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_07_2008_014mir", "source_sha256": "5c898d723c86b08169b21b0702f325d9359948e9aeb066aa6fb10bd8442d7d4e", "ja": "は～い！（なのです！）", "zh": "好～！（的喔！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
